 149.05 33.036 151.395 30.5131C153.74 27.9902 157.616 29.6331 160.522 29.613L160.526 29.6089Z\" fill=\"#FFFFFE\"><\/path><path d=\"M144.149 23.3925V23.0009C146.753 20.0945 149.518 14.4553 154.071 18.4475C154.612 18.9239 157.575 22.5327 157.599 23.0171C157.612 23.2794 157.571 23.4248 157.462 23.6589C157.349 23.9011 154.277 27.4372 153.966 27.7036C151.464 29.8753 148.711 28.7653 146.842 26.4805C145.978 25.4229 145.611 23.7679 144.149 23.3884V23.3925Z\" fill=\"#FFFFFE\"><\/path><path d=\"M183.68 6.72506C183.051 9.54265 184.912 11.2703 183.81 14.2454C182.284 18.3587 176.975 16.4534 173.73 16.405C174 13.5551 172.301 9.30449 174.796 7.11258C177.29 4.92067 180.899 7.01973 183.68 6.72506Z\" fill=\"#FFFFFE\"><\/path><path d=\"M99.7742 25.8145V4.56952H108.11V41.2789C108.11 41.3072 107.734 41.6826 107.706 41.6826H101.252C96.2139 33.3953 91.1721 25.0152 84.7134 17.7492V41.2789C84.7134 41.3072 84.338 41.6826 84.3097 41.6826H76.3777V4.56952H83.236C83.7527 4.56952 89.1658 11.4238 89.9328 12.3966C93.372 16.7562 96.3955 21.471 99.7782 25.8145H99.7742Z\" fill=\"#FFFFFE\"><\/path><path d=\"M48.0807 3.83888C58.0513 2.71265 66.9602 7.51225 68.9906 17.7412C71.893 32.3458 63.6622 43.596 48.3068 42.1872C27.3201 40.2617 27.3282 6.18015 48.0767 3.83888H48.0807ZM49.9618 11.1008C36.548 12.5621 39.0911 39.2525 54.2043 34.4368C64.3121 31.2155 63.0406 9.6759 49.9618 11.1008Z\" fill=\"#FFFFFE\"><\/path><path d=\"M143.879 4.56952V11.8315H132.851V41.4162H124.515V11.8315H113.491V4.56952H143.879Z\" fill=\"#FFFFFE\"><\/path><path d=\"M8.33571 29.3143V41.6867H0V5.11045C1.63081 4.79155 3.32218 4.46458 4.97721 4.30715C15.2747 3.31817 29.2295 4.06899 28.2324 17.8825C27.4695 28.4222 16.7643 29.3789 8.33571 29.3183V29.3143ZM8.33571 22.0523H13.5793C14.419 22.0523 17.4909 21.0311 18.1529 20.4417C20.5264 18.3346 20.0259 13.5753 17.0388 12.1342C16.5907 11.9163 14.75 11.2946 14.3826 11.2946H8.33168V22.0523H8.33571Z\" fill=\"#FFFFFE\"><\/path><\/g><defs><clipPath id=\"clip0_17_220\"><rect width=\"277\" height=\"45.9857\" fill=\"white\"><\/rect><\/clipPath><\/defs><\/svg>\t\t\t<\/p>\n<h2>Ganhe performance na gest\u00e3o de escalas da sua equipe com um sistema inteligente que  cuida disso para voc\u00ea e reduza at\u00e9 20% dos custos. Sem erros e sem burocracia com regras da CLT. <\/h2>\n<h2>A  PontoVit gera todos os tipos de escalas (6x1, 5x2, 12x36), de forma autom\u00e1tica, r\u00e1pida e com muita facilidade.<\/h2>\n<p>\t\t\t\t\t<a role=\"button\" id=\"abrir-popup\"><br \/>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tAgende Sua Demonstra\u00e7\u00e3o Agora<br \/>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a><\/p>\n<h2>\u00a0Entenda como um sistema de automa\u00e7\u00e3o de escalas  transforma sua gest\u00e3o de trabalho:<\/h2>\n<p>\t\t<iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Conheca o Ponto Vit, Sistema pioneiro em escala de trabalho.\" width=\"500\" height=\"281\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/WJl87KyZeGc?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen><\/iframe>\t\t<\/p>\n<h2>Reduza erros e retrabalho<\/h2>\n<h2>Crie escalas de forma automatizada, evite sobreposi\u00e7\u00e3o de turnos e falhas na aloca\u00e7\u00e3o de pessoal. Gere menos retrabalho e menos horas extras.<\/h2>\n<h2>Automatize e liberte sua equipe<\/h2>\n<h2>Libere tempo \u00e0 sua equipe de RH, automatize escalas e deixe que foquem em decis\u00f5es estrat\u00e9gicas que realmente impulsionam a produtividade.<\/h2>\n<h2>Aloque recursos estrategicamente<\/h2>\n<h2>De forma f\u00e1cil e automatizada, aloque melhor os recursos, evite sobrecarga ou falta de pessoal, e aumente a produtividade da sua equipe.<\/h2>\n<h2>Reduza gastos desnecess\u00e1rios<\/h2>\n<h2>Digitalize a gest\u00e3o de escalas e elimine os custos com pap\u00e9is e impress\u00f5es, permitindo que voc\u00ea invista de forma mais inteligente.<\/h2>\n<h2>Elimine falhas e atrasos<\/h2>\n<h2>Com a automa\u00e7\u00e3o, melhore a comunica\u00e7\u00e3o entre sua equipe e gestores, eliminando falhas de comunica\u00e7\u00e3o, atrasos e mal-entendidos que impactam a produtividade.<\/h2>\n<h2>Conformidade com a lei<\/h2>\n<h2>Mantenha as escalas de trabalho sempre dentro dos conformes das leis trabalhistas. Evite multas, processos e riscos jur\u00eddicos.<\/h2>\n<h2>Sem fidelidade ou multa de rescis\u00e3o<\/h2>\n<h2>Voc\u00ea fica conosco porque v\u00ea valor no que oferecemos, n\u00e3o porque \u00e9 obrigado a ficar.<\/h2>\n<h2>Sem pacotes limitados ou custos extras<\/h2>\n<h2>Tenha acesso a todas as funcionalidades sem surpresas no faturamento. N\u00e3o h\u00e1 necessidade de upgrades ou pacotes adicionais.<\/h2>\n<p>\t\t\t\t\t<a role=\"button\" id=\"abrir-popup\"><br \/>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\u00a0Fale com o nosso Especialista<br \/>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a><\/p>\n<h2>Veja como a PontoVit est\u00e1 transformando empresas<\/h2>\n<p>\t\t\t<svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"173\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 173 32\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M16.5 0L21.2963 9.39842L31.7169 11.0557L24.2606 18.5216L25.9046 28.9443L16.5 24.16L7.09544 28.9443L8.73938 18.5216L1.2831 11.0557L11.7037 9.39842L16.5 0Z\" fill=\"#FFA000\"><\/path><path d=\"M51.5 0L56.2963 9.39842L66.7169 11.0557L59.2606 18.5216L60.9046 28.9443L51.5 24.16L42.0954 28.9443L43.7394 18.5216L36.2831 11.0557L46.7037 9.39842L51.5 0Z\" fill=\"#FFA000\"><\/path><path d=\"M121.5 0L126.296 9.39842L136.717 11.0557L129.261 18.5216L130.905 28.9443L121.5 24.16L112.095 28.9443L113.739 18.5216L106.283 11.0557L116.704 9.39842L121.5 0Z\" fill=\"#FFA000\"><\/path><path d=\"M86.5 0L91.2963 9.39842L101.717 11.0557L94.2606 18.5216L95.9046 28.9443L86.5 24.16L77.0954 28.9443L78.7394 18.5216L71.2831 11.0557L81.7037 9.39842L86.5 0Z\" fill=\"#FFA000\"><\/path><path d=\"M156.5 0L161.296 9.39842L171.717 11.0557L164.261 18.5216L165.905 28.9443L156.5 24.16L147.095 28.9443L148.739 18.5216L141.283 11.0557L151.704 9.39842L156.5 0Z\" fill=\"#FFA000\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t<\/p>\n<h2>Rafael Veratti<\/h2>\n<h2>Veratti supermercados<\/h2>\n<h2>O PontoVit simplifica a gest\u00e3o das escalas 6x1, desdobrando o processo com expertise, facilitando gest\u00e3o e comunica\u00e7\u00e3o com colaboradores. Parceiros de longa data, a ferramenta \u00e9 constantemente desenvolvida.<\/h2>\n<p>\t\t\t<svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"173\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 173 32\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M16.5 0L21.2963 9.39842L31.7169 11.0557L24.2606 18.5216L25.9046 28.9443L16.5 24.16L7.09544 28.9443L8.73938 18.5216L1.2831 11.0557L11.7037 9.39842L16.5 0Z\" fill=\"#FFA000\"><\/path><path d=\"M51.5 0L56.2963 9.39842L66.7169 11.0557L59.2606 18.5216L60.9046 28.9443L51.5 24.16L42.0954 28.9443L43.7394 18.5216L36.2831 11.0557L46.7037 9.39842L51.5 0Z\" fill=\"#FFA000\"><\/path><path d=\"M121.5 0L126.296 9.39842L136.717 11.0557L129.261 18.5216L130.905 28.9443L121.5 24.16L112.095 28.9443L113.739 18.5216L106.283 11.0557L116.704 9.39842L121.5 0Z\" fill=\"#FFA000\"><\/path><path d=\"M86.5 0L91.2963 9.39842L101.717 11.0557L94.2606 18.5216L95.9046 28.9443L86.5 24.16L77.0954 28.9443L78.7394 18.5216L71.2831 11.0557L81.7037 9.39842L86.5 0Z\" fill=\"#FFA000\"><\/path><path d=\"M156.5 0L161.296 9.39842L171.717 11.0557L164.261 18.5216L165.905 28.9443L156.5 24.16L147.095 28.9443L148.739 18.5216L141.283 11.0557L151.704 9.39842L156.5 0Z\" fill=\"#FFA000\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t<\/p>\n<h2>Tiago Andrade<\/h2>\n<h2>B\u00e1sica Adm de Condom\u00ednios<\/h2>\n<h2>A B\u00e1sica agradece a PONTO VIT pelo software de Gest\u00e3o de Escalas de Trabalho, trazendo facilidade, economia de tempo e redu\u00e7\u00e3o de burocracias na folha de pagamento, entre outros benef\u00edcios. Super indico a ferramenta.<\/h2>\n<p>\t\t\t<svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"173\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 173 32\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M16.5 0L21.2963 9.39842L31.7169 11.0557L24.2606 18.5216L25.9046 28.9443L16.5 24.16L7.09544 28.9443L8.73938 18.5216L1.2831 11.0557L11.7037 9.39842L16.5 0Z\" fill=\"#FFA000\"><\/path><path d=\"M51.5 0L56.2963 9.39842L66.7169 11.0557L59.2606 18.5216L60.9046 28.9443L51.5 24.16L42.0954 28.9443L43.7394 18.5216L36.2831 11.0557L46.7037 9.39842L51.5 0Z\" fill=\"#FFA000\"><\/path><path d=\"M121.5 0L126.296 9.39842L136.717 11.0557L129.261 18.5216L130.905 28.9443L121.5 24.16L112.095 28.9443L113.739 18.5216L106.283 11.0557L116.704 9.39842L121.5 0Z\" fill=\"#FFA000\"><\/path><path d=\"M86.5 0L91.2963 9.39842L101.717 11.0557L94.2606 18.5216L95.9046 28.9443L86.5 24.16L77.0954 28.9443L78.7394 18.5216L71.2831 11.0557L81.7037 9.39842L86.5 0Z\" fill=\"#FFA000\"><\/path><path d=\"M156.5 0L161.296 9.39842L171.717 11.0557L164.261 18.5216L165.905 28.9443L156.5 24.16L147.095 28.9443L148.739 18.5216L141.283 11.0557L151.704 9.39842L156.5 0Z\" fill=\"#FFA000\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t<\/p>\n<h2>Cristiano<\/h2>\n<h2>Posto de Combust\u00edvel Vargem Linda<\/h2>\n<h2>Com esta ferramenta, o PontoVit, nos tornamos produtivos e conseguimos nos organizar melhor, em rela\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e0s Escalas de trabalho. Recomendo!<\/h2>\n<p>\t\t\t\t\t<a role=\"button\"><br \/>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tGostou dos resultados? Clique e Seja o pr\u00f3ximo!<br \/>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a><\/p>\n<h2>Nossos Clientes<\/h2>\n<p>\t\t\t<svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/1999\/xlink\" width=\"80\" height=\"79\" viewBox=\"0 0 80 79\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"0.778564\" y=\"0.00830078\" width=\"78.5526\" height=\"78.5526\" fill=\"url(#pattern0_38_50)\"><\/rect><defs><pattern id=\"pattern0_38_50\" patternContentUnits=\"objectBoundingBox\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\"><use xlink:href=\"#image0_38_50\" transform=\"scale(0.00555556)\"><\/use><\/pattern><image id=\"image0_38_50\" width=\"180\" height=\"180\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" xlink:href=\"data:image\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAALQAAAC0CAIAAACyr5FlAAAZAUlEQVR42u2cefSN1ffHP831a04Dv0oZViJSQmlQZCokRDRImaOUoohFSIYmpQEhlgaJtFBhpVpYPyVjqchcIkPzXPi91n2v9jq\/89x7P\/fz6WP9\/